# BMD library data — large binary files (3.3 GiB total, several >100 MB).
# Treated as external content: deploy.sh syncs them from /opt into the
# source tree at build time. Keeping them in git bloated the history and
# made pushes fail against GitHub's 100 MB-per-file limit.
src/main/resources/data/bmd/*.bm2
